{
  "slug": "neonpanel",
  "name": "Neonpanel",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "NeonPanel e-commerce intelligence suite for Amazon sellers. 8 specialist AI agents covering supply chain, inventory, marketing, accounting, forecasting, and financial analysis. Connects to NeonPanel's MCP API (60+ tools) for live data access with OAuth2 authentication.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `april-market-intelligence` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"keyword gaps\", \"search term momentum\", \"competitive landscape\", \"market…), `dorian-replenishment` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"purchase order planning\", \"PO recommendations\", \"reorder points\", \"stock…), `kio-forecasting` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"sales forecast\", \"demand planning\", \"forecast scenarios\", \"forecast comparison\",…), `mark-marketing-research` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"Amazon listing audit\", \"listing optimization\", \"listing compliance\", \"keyword…), `marta-accounting` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"P&L analysis\", \"profit and loss\", \"general ledger\", \"journal…), `neon-customer-success` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"NeonPanel onboarding\", \"data import\", \"upload template\", \"QuickBooks/Xero setup\",…), `neonpanel-onboarding` (Use this skill when the user has just installed the NeonPanel Claude plugin, asks how to set it…), `nina-supply-chain` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"supply chain analysis\", \"inventory tracking\", \"shipment status\", \"warehouse…), and 1 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `neonpanel`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install neonpanel@claude-community` from `neonpanel/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
